"""Force-driven, remeshed dynamics for an axisymmetric sphere-film bridge.

The force and pressure solves are fully three-dimensional on tetrahedra.  The
axisymmetry is used only to reparameterize the boundary between timesteps so a
micron-scale overhanging neck can move farther than one local edge without
inverting the Lagrangian mesh.
"""

